    "about.notices.open.hint": {
      "comment": "Second line of the two notice button rows in the About page's Acknowledgements card, and the VoiceOver hint for them. Not formatted. It says what activating the row does: it opens a folder that is stored inside the app, in the Finder window. Keep the product name Finder unchanged.",
