    "cad.upAxis": {
      "comment": "Formatted key. Title of a button in the 3D model controls that switches which model axis points up on screen. Argument 1 is the axis currently pointing up, a technical letter (Z or Y) that must not be translated. The button is narrow: keep the wording short. This is a per-view choice that is not saved.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
