    "failure.body.unavailableContent": {
      "comment": "Body under the title failure.title.unavailableContent: why it happened and what to do next, in one or two complete sentences ending with a period. The last sentence is the next step for the reader. Situation: the file’s bytes are not on this Mac (a cloud placeholder); the app does not download files and does not promise to.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Its content is stored online, for example in iCloud Drive. Download it first, then preview it again."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "İçeriği çevrimiçi olarak saklanıyor (örneğin iCloud Drive içinde). Önce dosyayı indirin, sonra yeniden önizleyin."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Inhalt liegt online, zum Beispiel in iCloud Drive. Laden Sie die Datei zuerst herunter und zeigen Sie sie dann erneut in der Vorschau an."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son contenu est stocké en ligne, par exemple dans iCloud Drive. Téléchargez-le d’abord, puis affichez-le à nouveau."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其内容存储在线上，例如 iCloud 云盘。请先下载文件，然后再次预览。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内容がオンラインに保存されています（iCloud Drive など）。先にダウンロードしてから、もう一度プレビューしてください。"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "इसकी सामग्री ऑनलाइन संग्रहीत है, उदाहरण के लिए iCloud Drive में। पहले इसे डाउनलोड करें, फिर दोबारा पूर्वावलोकन करें।"
          }
        },
        "ku-Latn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Naveroka wê li ser înternetê tê tomarkirin, mînak di iCloud Drive de. Pêşî wê dakêşe, paşê dîsa pêşdîtin bike."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Его содержимое хранится онлайн, например в iCloud Drive. Сначала загрузите файл, затем снова откройте предпросмотр."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kontennya disimpan secara daring, misalnya di iCloud Drive. Unduh dulu, lalu pratinjau lagi."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "এর বিষয়বস্তু অনলাইনে রাখা আছে, যেমন iCloud Drive-এ। আগে ফাইলটি ডাউনলোড করুন, তারপর আবার প্রিভিউ করুন।"
          }
        },
        "ha": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ana adana abubuwan da ke ciki a kan layi, misali a iCloud Drive. Fara sauke shi, sannan a sake duba shi."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O conteúdo está armazenado on-line, por exemplo no iCloud Drive. Baixe-o primeiro e depois pré-visualize novamente."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Su contenido está almacenado en línea, por ejemplo en iCloud Drive. Descárgalo primero y vuelve a previsualizarlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "failure.body.unreadableFile": {
      "comment": "Body under the title failure.title.unreadableFile: why it happened and what to do next, in one or two complete sentences ending with a period. The last sentence is the next step for the reader. Situation: the file exists but could not be read (permissions or an unavailable disk); raw system error text is never shown.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You may not have permission to read it, or the disk it is on may be unavailable. Check access to the file, then try again."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dosyayı okuma izniniz olmayabilir veya bulunduğu disk kullanılamıyor olabilir. Dosyaya erişimi kontrol edin, sonra yeniden deneyin."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Möglicherweise fehlt Ihnen die Berechtigung zum Lesen, oder der Datenträger, auf dem sie liegt, ist nicht verfügbar. Prüfen Sie den Zugriff auf die Datei und versuchen Sie es dann erneut."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous n’avez peut-être pas l’autorisation de le lire, ou le disque qui le contient est peut-être indisponible. Vérifiez l’accès au fichier, puis réessayez."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你可能没有读取权限，或其所在的磁盘不可用。请检查对该文件的访问权限，然后重试。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "読み取りの権限がないか、ファイルがあるディスクを利用できない可能性があります。ファイルへのアクセスを確認してから、もう一度お試しください。"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "हो सकता है कि इसे पढ़ने की अनुमति आपके पास न हो, या जिस डिस्क पर यह है वह उपलब्ध न हो। फ़ाइल तक पहुँच जाँचें, फिर दोबारा कोशिश करें।"
          }
        },
        "ku-Latn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dibe ku destûra xwendina wê li cem te tune be, an dîska ku pel li ser e nayê bikaranîn. Gihîştina pelê kontrol bike, paşê dîsa biceribîne."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Возможно, у вас нет разрешения на чтение файла или диск, на котором он находится, недоступен. Проверьте доступ к файлу и повторите попытку."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anda mungkin tidak memiliki izin untuk membacanya, atau disk tempatnya berada mungkin tidak tersedia. Periksa akses ke berkas, lalu coba lagi."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "হয়তো ফাইলটি পড়ার অনুমতি আপনার নেই, অথবা এটি যে ডিস্কে আছে সেটি উপলব্ধ নয়। ফাইলে অ্যাক্সেস পরীক্ষা করুন, তারপর আবার চেষ্টা করুন।"
          }
        },
        "ha": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wataƙila ba ku da izinin karanta shi, ko kuma faifan da yake a kai ba ya samuwa. Duba damar shiga fayil ɗin, sannan sake gwadawa."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Você pode não ter permissão para lê-lo, ou o disco em que ele está pode estar indisponível. Verifique o acesso ao arquivo e tente novamente."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puede que no tengas permiso para leerlo, o que el disco donde está no esté disponible. Comprueba el acceso al archivo y vuelve a intentarlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "failure.body.unsupportedEncoding": {
      "comment": "Body under the title failure.title.unsupportedEncoding: why it happened and what to do next, in one or two complete sentences ending with a period. The last sentence is the next step for the reader. Situation: the text encoding is not UTF-8 or UTF-16.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This preview reads UTF-8 and UTF-16 text. Save the file in one of these encodings, then preview it again."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu önizleme UTF-8 ve UTF-16 metinleri okur. Dosyayı bu kodlamalardan birinde kaydedin, sonra yeniden önizleyin."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Vorschau liest UTF-8- und UTF-16-Text. Speichern Sie die Datei in einer dieser Kodierungen und zeigen Sie sie dann erneut an."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet aperçu lit le texte en UTF-8 et UTF-16. Enregistrez le fichier dans l’un de ces encodages, puis affichez-le à nouveau."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此预览可读取 UTF-8 和 UTF-16 文本。请将文件存储为其中一种编码，然后再次预览。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このプレビューが読み込めるのは UTF-8 と UTF-16 のテキストです。ファイルをいずれかのエンコーディングで保存してから、もう一度プレビューしてください。"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "यह पूर्वावलोकन UTF-8 और UTF-16 टेक्स्ट पढ़ता है। फ़ाइल को इनमें से किसी एक एन्कोडिंग में सहेजें, फिर दोबारा पूर्वावलोकन करें।"
          }
        },
        "ku-Latn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ev pêşdîtin metna UTF-8 û UTF-16 dixwîne. Pelê bi yek ji van kodkirinan tomar bike, paşê dîsa pêşdîtin bike."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Этот предпросмотр читает текст в UTF-8 и UTF-16. Сохраните файл в одной из этих кодировок и откройте предпросмотр снова."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pratinjau ini membaca teks UTF-8 dan UTF-16. Simpan berkas dengan salah satu pengodean ini, lalu pratinjau lagi."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "এই প্রিভিউ UTF-8 ও UTF-16 লেখা পড়ে। ফাইলটি এই এনকোডিংগুলোর একটিতে সংরক্ষণ করুন, তারপর আবার প্রিভিউ করুন।"
          }
        },
        "ha": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wannan dubawa tana karanta rubutun UTF-8 da UTF-16. Adana fayil ɗin a ɗaya daga cikin waɗannan tsare-tsaren lambar, sannan a sake duba shi."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta pré-visualização lê texto em UTF-8 e UTF-16. Salve o arquivo em uma dessas codificações e pré-visualize novamente."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta vista previa lee texto en UTF-8 y UTF-16. Guarda el archivo en una de estas codificaciones y vuelve a previsualizarlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "failure.body.unsupportedFormat": {
      "comment": "Body under the title failure.title.unsupportedFormat: why it happened and what to do next, in one or two complete sentences ending with a period. The last sentence is the next step for the reader. Situation: the file’s type is not one this preview handles.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This preview cannot show this type of file. Open it in an app that supports it."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu önizleme bu dosya türünü gösteremez. Bunu destekleyen bir uygulamada açın."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Vorschau kann diesen Dateityp nicht anzeigen. Öffnen Sie die Datei in einer App, die ihn unterstützt."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet aperçu ne peut pas afficher ce type de fichier. Ouvrez-le dans une application qui le prend en charge."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此预览无法显示这类文件。请使用支持它的应用打开。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このプレビューではこの種類のファイルを表示できません。対応しているアプリで開いてください。"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "यह पूर्वावलोकन इस प्रकार की फ़ाइल नहीं दिखा सकता। इसे ऐसे ऐप में खोलें जो इसे समर्थित करता हो।"
          }
        },
        "ku-Latn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ev pêşdîtin nikare vê cureya pelê nîşan bide. Pelê di sepanekê de veke ku vê cureyê piştgirî dike."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Этот предпросмотр не может показать файлы такого типа. Откройте файл в приложении, которое его поддерживает."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pratinjau ini tidak dapat menampilkan jenis berkas ini. Buka di aplikasi yang mendukungnya."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "এই প্রিভিউ এই ধরনের ফাইল দেখাতে পারে না। এটি এমন অ্যাপে খুলুন যা এটি সমর্থন করে।"
          }
        },
        "ha": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wannan dubawa ba za ta iya nuna irin wannan fayil ba. Buɗe shi a cikin manhajar da ke tallafa masa."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta pré-visualização não consegue mostrar este tipo de arquivo. Abra-o em um app compatível."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta vista previa no puede mostrar este tipo de archivo. Ábrelo en una app compatible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "failure.body.unsupportedVariant": {
      "comment": "Body under the title failure.title.unsupportedVariant: why it happened and what to do next, in one or two complete sentences ending with a period. The last sentence is the next step for the reader. Situation: the file type is supported but this particular version or variant of it has no reader (a versioned or compressed sub-format).",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The file type is supported, but this version of it is not. Open it in the app that made it."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dosya türü destekleniyor, ancak bunun bu sürümü desteklenmiyor. Dosyayı oluşturan uygulamada açın."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Dateityp wird unterstützt, diese Version davon jedoch nicht. Öffnen Sie die Datei in der App, mit der sie erstellt wurde."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce type de fichier est pris en charge, mais pas cette version-ci. Ouvrez-le dans l’application qui l’a créé."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此文件类型受支持，但此版本不受支持。请在创建它的应用中打开。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この種類のファイルには対応していますが、このバージョンには対応していません。作成したアプリで開いてください。"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "यह फ़ाइल प्रकार समर्थित है, लेकिन इसका यह संस्करण समर्थित नहीं है। इसे उस ऐप में खोलें जिसने इसे बनाया है।"
          }
        },
        "ku-Latn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cureya pelê tê piştgirîkirin, lê ev guhertoya wê nayê piştgirîkirin. Pelê di sepana ku çêkiriye de veke."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Этот тип файлов поддерживается, но эта его версия — нет. Откройте файл в приложении, которое его создало."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jenis berkas ini didukung, tetapi versi ini tidak. Buka di aplikasi yang membuatnya."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "এই ফাইলের ধরন সমর্থিত, কিন্তু এর এই সংস্করণটি নয়। যে অ্যাপ এটি তৈরি করেছে তাতে খুলুন।"
          }
        },
        "ha": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ana tallafa wa irin wannan fayil, amma ba a tallafa wa wannan sigar tasa ba. Buɗe shi a cikin manhajar da ta ƙirƙira shi."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este tipo de arquivo é compatível, mas esta versão dele não é. Abra-o no app que o criou."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este tipo de archivo es compatible, pero esta versión no lo es. Ábrelo en la app que lo creó."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "failure.deadlineExceeded": {
      "comment": "Cooperative preview deadline rejection.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
