    "finding.launch.job": {
      "comment": "Safety finding for a launchd job: states what the file is. launchd is the macOS service that starts programs, and a launchd job is a property list that tells macOS which program to start and when; keep the name launchd. No program name or path is shown. Not formatted; no placeholder. No file content, name or path appears in this sentence. Draft translations pending native-speaker review.",
