    "finding.profile.expired": {
      "comment": "Safety finding for a provisioning profile (the file that lets an app run on registered devices): the profile's validity period has ended. Use the language's established term for provisioning profile. Not formatted; no placeholder. No file content, name or path appears in this sentence. Draft translations pending native-speaker review.",
