    "notebook.output.figureInPages": {
      "comment": "One inert line in a rendered Jupyter notebook, under an output whose saved picture is shown in the Pages mode instead (replaces the line \"Output not shown\" for that picture). Formatted: %1$@ is the figure's number, formatted for the display locale, matching the label \"Figure n of m\" in Pages. \"Pages\" is the name of the preview mode (the key preview.mode.pages): keep it consistent with that word and inflect it as the sentence needs. Never describes the picture's content. No plural: the number is a position, not a quantity. All translations are drafts pending native-speaker review.",
