    "preview.chip.copied": {
      "comment": "Short confirmation in a small outlined chip beside the info button of a file preview. It shows for about a second and a half after the reader copies something, and VoiceOver says it once. One word or short phrase without a final period: it must fit a chip about 100 points wide at 11 point type. It is the only copy confirmation, so use it for every kind of copy (selected text, the whole text, concealed text, rows). Not formatted.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
