      "comment": "VoiceOver hint of the toggle that folds or opens the Contents list beside the document on a wide preview. The list holds the headings of the document and follows where the reader is. One sentence ending with a period; does not repeat the button label. Not formatted. Not formatted and no count. Drafts pending native-speaker review.",
