    "preview.openapi.unresolvedReferences": {
      "comment": "Limits sentence under the Endpoints table: how many path items name a reference this preview cannot follow inside the document, so their operations are not listed. The first formatter argument selects the plural category and is never printed; the second is the count formatted for the presentation locale and every variant prints it as %2$@. Draft translations pending native-speaker review.",
