    "preview.table.shownRowsOfTotal": {
      "comment": "Bounded table rows with an exact whole-file total. %2$@ is the shown count; %3$@ is the total. The plural selector is the shown count. Never claim an exact total for a partial read or lower bound. %2$@ is locale-formatted. Argument 1 is only the plural selector. Translations are drafts pending native-speaker review.",
